.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652535/000165253526000028/ex-991_26q1xearnings.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-09", "n": 4.17, "z": 0.07, "rz": -1.91, "earn": true, "q": "With Q4 results favorably aligned with our earlier expectations, our focus now shifts to the strengthening demand environment ahead for fiscal 2026,", "a": "commented Phil Barros, Ichor’s CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652535/000165253526000008/ex-991_25q4xearnings.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-03", "n": 4.81, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Phil has been instrumental in developing our technology roadmap in close partnership with our leading customers, creating innovative and proprietary products that drive customer value, and we are confident that he is the right person to drive Ichor to the next level,", "a": "said Iain MacKenzie, chairman of Ichor", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652535/000165253525000076/ex991_251103xpressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-03", "n": 4.14, "z": -0.13, "rz": -1.72, "earn": true, "q": "The customer demand environment for etch and deposition strengthened during the third quarter, resulting in an acceleration of gas panel integration deliveries and total revenues at the upper end of our expectations,", "a": "commented Jeff Andreson, Ichor’s CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652535/000165253525000075/ex-991_25q3xearnings.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-11-02", "z": 0.19, "mood": "usual"}, "say_do": {"mood": "usual", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 43, "verdict": {"it": "Leggermente ribassista", "en": "Mildly bearish"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track rec